    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sealed into a decaying vessel, surrounded by an irradiated green ocean and nothing but a rusted mounted camera to view your surroundings, will you be able to survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mechanics where you have to balance oxygen, power, food and water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short enclosed gameplay where you have to use a grainy camera to view your exterior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 1 hour gameplay with a linear but intriguing atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror survival game where your life depends on staying focused and on edge.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sealed into a decaying vessel, surrounded by an irradiated green ocean and nothing but a rusted mounted camera to view your surroundings, will you be able to survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mechanics where you have to balance oxygen, power, food and water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short enclosed gameplay where you have to use a grainy camera to view your exterior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 1 hour gameplay with a linear but intriguing atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror survival game where your life depends on staying focused and on edge.</p>",
